[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15000.309, "timestamp": "04:10:00", "text": "それ。ヒーラーズはすごかった。しないつもりだ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15003.189, "timestamp": "04:10:03", "text": "嘘だ、彼らは狂っていた。ちくしょう。見てください"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 15003.594, "timestamp": "04:10:03", "author": "@joqnix", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/1rNe-FcvCKbSXpzuK86tx4EpeshYhox1KGRLnP8jvk1YWjbcndAtJwbDs74VZeGf462RnXuCJPE=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "hello bread the strimmee"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15006.55, "timestamp": "04:10:06", "text": "それ。彼にバフを与えた後、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15008.71, "timestamp": "04:10:08", "text": "この男はちょっと調子に乗っていた。この男"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15012.469, "timestamp": "04:10:12", "text": "飛び出した。そして、ああ、私を見て"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 15015.543, "timestamp": "04:10:15", "author": "@joqnix", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/1rNe-FcvCKbSXpzuK86tx4EpeshYhox1KGRLnP8jvk1YWjbcndAtJwbDs74VZeGf462RnXuCJPE=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "big fan~"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15015.59, "timestamp": "04:10:15", "text": "統計はそれ自体で10最終と言っていると思う"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15020.55, "timestamp": "04:10:20", "text": "28k に達する、50k が何なのかはわからないが、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15023.309, "timestamp": "04:10:23", "text": "ブロックされました。ああ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15030.59, "timestamp": "04:10:30", "text": "神。こんにちはパン"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15033.83, "timestamp": "04:10:33", "text": "流れ出る。あなたは5000ドル持っていました。私は5つ持っていました"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15037.51, "timestamp": "04:10:37", "text": "それは5KOではなく、5回の最終ヒットだ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15039.51, "timestamp": "04:10:39", "text": "あなたが知っている。うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15040.269, "timestamp": "04:10:40", "text": "の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15047.91, "timestamp": "04:10:47", "text": "神。だから良かった。まあまあだったよ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15050.189, "timestamp": "04:10:50", "text": "知ってるよ、私は変なことはしない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15053.75, "timestamp": "04:10:53", "tex